            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "HOLLY9000"
            },
            "reviewBody": "To me this is more of an idea on how to cutely present chips and dip than really a recipe. That being said, it was very cute and looked good at our 4th of July party. Instead of using the ranch dip, I mixed up a vegetable dip. (I also had a 7 layer dip that included ranch dip).",
